{"version":3,"kind":"Notebook","sha256":"74ca6fcc79138408af385e7eafc0f57b0f7e42ba9f346c873fde13720d9295bf","slug":"chromatin-accessibility.introduction","location":"/chromatin_accessibility/introduction.ipynb","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"单细胞 ATAC-seq","authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Christopher Lance","given":"Christopher","family":"Lance"},"name":"Christopher Lance","id":"contributors-introduction-generated-uid-0"},{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Laura Martens","given":"Laura","family":"Martens"},"name":"Laura Martens","id":"contributors-introduction-generated-uid-1"},{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Lukas Heumos","given":"Lukas","family":"Heumos"},"name":"Lukas Heumos","roles":["Writing – review & editing"],"id":"contributors-introduction-generated-uid-2"}],"content_includes_title":false,"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","display_name":"Python 3 (ipykernel)","language":"python"},"github":"https://github.com/theislab/single-cell-best-practices","settings":{"output_matplotlib_strings":"remove"},"numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"source_url":"https://github.com/theislab/single-cell-best-practices/blob/main/.build/v2-candidate/maintenance-2026-09-13-01/overlay/chromatin_accessibility/introduction.ipynb","edit_url":"https://github.com/theislab/single-cell-best-practices/edit/main/.build/v2-candidate/maintenance-2026-09-13-01/overlay/chromatin_accessibility/introduction.ipynb","thumbnail":"/single-cell-best-practices-zh/build/mechanisms_overview-01b1d5ef3c5149977611d6e08ae0dc40.png","exports":[{"format":"ipynb","filename":"introduction.ipynb","url":"/single-cell-best-practices-zh/build/introduction-c46d719e7c3ac26c7ecbf004d45b2a52.ipynb"}]},"widgets":{},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"details","children":[{"type":"summary","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🧠 关键要点","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"pw53VQwKzy"}],"key":"o680fbTAPB"},{"type":"card","url":"/chromatin-accessibility/introduction#chromatin-accessibility-introduction-key-takeaway-1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"染色质可及性（chromatin accessibility）是刻画细胞身份的重要信息，与基因表达谱互为补充。它反映 DNA 甲基化（DNA methylation）、组蛋白修饰（histone modification）和转录因子（Transcription Factor, TF）活性等机制共同作用下的调控状态，这些机制共同影响基因表达与细胞分化。","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"key":"J3QMIDFA8c"}],"key":"tbAR65Lbxt"}],"urlSource":"/chromatin-accessibility/introduction#chromatin-accessibility-introduction-key-takeaway-1","key":"FAVAefdIGG"},{"type":"card","url":"/chromatin-accessibility/introduction#chromatin-accessibility-introduction-key-takeaway-2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"单细胞转座酶可及染色质测序（single-cell assay for transposase-accessible chromatin using sequencing, scATAC-seq）数据高度稀疏：每个细胞的 DNA 拷贝有限，许多特征（feature）的计数（Count）为零。分析时需定义具有生物学意义的 feature，例如峰（peak）或基因组窗口（bin），并注意保留细胞类型特异的可及性信号。","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"lbpsRZ9FGH"}],"key":"IVUQVrRvzU"}],"urlSource":"/chromatin-accessibility/introduction#chromatin-accessibility-introduction-key-takeaway-2","key":"OrZmYJWNDb"}],"key":"VnqnSaKxd3"},{"type":"comment","value":" END DROPDOWNS ","key":"ibQhiCVIRz"}],"key":"NSAQpZcxaN"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","data":{"tags":[]},"children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"研究动机","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"wCKpGZwykf"}],"label":"chromatin-accessibility-introduction-key-takeaway-1","identifier":"chromatin-accessibility-introduction-key-takeaway-1","html_id":"chromatin-accessibility-introduction-key-takeaway-1","key":"S9gWPU4IoM"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"同一生物体的大多数体细胞拥有基本相同的基因组，却能形成免疫系统中的自然杀伤细胞、传递电化学信号的神经元等功能迥异的细胞。前几章介绍了如何根据基因表达谱推断细胞身份与功能。基因表达受 DNA 甲基化（DNA methylation）、组蛋白修饰（histone modification）以及转录因子（Transcription Factor, TF）活性等多种机制共同调控。","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"key":"eHANAjkZxV"},{"type":"crossReference","label":"Chromatin","identifier":"term-chromatin","children":[{"type":"text","value":"染色质","key":"Axe2Azu1rZ"}],"kind":"definitionTerm","template":"{name}","resolved":true,"html_id":"term-chromatin","remote":true,"url":"/glossary","dataUrl":"/glossary.json","key":"T4CMYlWXQP"},{"type":"text","value":" 可及性（chromatin accessibility）反映了这些机制共同作用下的调控状态，为描述细胞身份的 ","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"key":"H1lHSb2ItS"},{"type":"crossReference","label":"Messenger RNA (mRNA)","identifier":"term-messenger rna (mrna)","children":[{"type":"text","value":"信使 RNA（messenger RNA, mRNA）","key":"BlltqltJSB"}],"kind":"definitionTerm","template":"{name}","resolved":true,"html_id":"term-messenger-rna-mrna","remote":true,"url":"/glossary","dataUrl":"/glossary.json","key":"fI1DmpwehN"},{"type":"text","value":" 水平提供互补信息。分析染色质可及性谱，还能揭示单细胞 RNA 测序（Single-Cell RNA Sequencing, scRNA-seq）可能无法捕捉的基因调控机制与细胞分化过程。","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"key":"nOozmrsEG1"}],"key":"mcYs36y3hz"}],"visibility":"show","key":"oMLTyYNHG8"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","data":{"tags":[]},"children":[{"type":"container","kind":"figure","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/single-cell-best-practices-zh/build/mechanisms_overview-01b1d5ef3c5149977611d6e08ae0dc40.png","alt":"染色质可及性的调控机制","width":"800px","key":"G8Hcj72bhp","urlSource":"../_static/images/sc_atac/mechanisms_overview.png"},{"type":"caption","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"captionNumber","kind":"figure","label":"Mechanisms influencing chromatin accessibility","identifier":"mechanisms influencing chromatin accessibility","html_id":"mechanisms-influencing-chromatin-accessibility","enumerator":"1","children":[{"type":"text","value":"图 ","key":"rn3E0l63fI"},{"type":"text","value":"1","key":"LoBjpU8Spe"},{"type":"text","value":"：","key":"KLuPsZB3oD"}],"template":"图 %s：","key":"JHiJ9pjTUL"},{"type":"text","value":"影响染色质可及性的机制概览。使用以下工具绘制：","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"GFhPnKkiIQ"},{"type":"link","url":"http://BioRender.com","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"BioRender.com","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"IrfOgXb2Mt"}],"urlSource":"http://BioRender.com","key":"tyWYh91Yef"},{"type":"text","value":"。","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"bZeajuWaty"}],"key":"tLyz32M6xd"}],"key":"VXgkyw83cq"}],"class":"bg-primary mb-1","label":"Mechanisms influencing chromatin accessibility","identifier":"mechanisms influencing chromatin accessibility","enumerator":"1","html_id":"mechanisms-influencing-chromatin-accessibility","key":"aSYsXEC0aB"}],"visibility":"show","key":"cAblLEaDWe"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","data":{"tags":[]},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"如上图所示，从染色质的高级结构到 DNA 化学修饰，多个层次的调控都会影响可及性。","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"x9atxZ9d9F"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"(1)","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"fpRBZyXBqi"}],"key":"mrZAFODaWz"},{"type":"text","value":" 支架/基质附着区（Scaffold/Matrix Attachment Regions, S/MARs）以及核周的核孔复合物（Nuclear Pore Complexes, NPCs）、核纤层蛋白等，共同参与染色质的空间组织，影响其致密程度和基因表达 ","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"Nso3VKvTFR"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"atac:narwade_mapping_2019","identifier":"atac:narwade_mapping_2019","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Narwade ","key":"eNzPO0WOwL"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"zIVbjr2STr"}],"key":"f47tbwr362"},{"type":"text","value":", 2019","key":"RgOzFrdvyY"}],"enumerator":"1","key":"krqKixWPNc"},{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"atac:buchwalter_coaching_2019","identifier":"atac:buchwalter_coaching_2019","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Buchwalter ","key":"o2esqWjnkj"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"luLFPw7njl"}],"key":"kJighmyk9F"},{"type":"text","value":", 2019","key":"yLiVI2fa40"}],"enumerator":"2","key":"T6iSFWolTc"}],"key":"okDT9q07F8"},{"type":"text","value":"。","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"Q9TlSX3i8w"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"(2, 3)","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"nsyyBz3Ufk"}],"key":"JQf7sRLBu5"},{"type":"text","value":" 在局部尺度上，致密的异染色质（heterochromatin）与开放的常染色质（euchromatin）具有不同的可及性。ATP 依赖或非依赖的染色质重塑（chromatin remodeling）复合物，以及乙酰化、甲基化、磷酸化等组蛋白修饰，都能调节这一状态。","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"c5ryEZfIvN"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"(4)","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"csBkCSHvSA"}],"key":"cs1GTtKg4G"},{"type":"text","value":" TF 结合也会影响核小体定位，并招募组蛋白修饰酶与染色质重塑因子。","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"paentCWjSR"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"(5)","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"UNA2Ss31I8"}],"key":"RvOaFCcNgn"},{"type":"text","value":" 在 DNA 层面，","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"Ol9ORX9hed"},{"type":"crossReference","label":"CpG","identifier":"term-cpg","children":[{"type":"text","value":"CpG","key":"JkTRkChHBj"}],"kind":"definitionTerm","template":"{name}","resolved":true,"html_id":"term-cpg","remote":true,"url":"/glossary","dataUrl":"/glossary.json","key":"g8kXvsDbEo"},{"type":"text","value":" 位点的甲基化会影响 TF、组蛋白修饰酶等蛋白质的结合亲和力，这些作用可共同促使相应基因组区域沉默。还可观看 ","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"UE4IAnRxe1"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XelGO582s4U","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"这段两分钟动画","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"l1wDun9Zrv"}],"urlSource":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XelGO582s4U","key":"CHYF0eggA3"},{"type":"text","value":"，了解表观遗传学与基因活性调控（由伊利诺伊大学 SQE 的 Nicole Ethen 制作）。关于基因组调控和 TF 活性的系统综述，可参阅 ","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"rUBKyOd2Ko"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"atac:isbel_generating_2022","identifier":"atac:isbel_generating_2022","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Isbel ","key":"NNkKXkjHIU"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"SfH5htNHwy"}],"key":"vxcSpxk4oU"},{"type":"text","value":", 2022","key":"T0e6SgZXq5"}],"enumerator":"3","key":"scSlf4fAZb"}],"key":"NfqJTCei4q"},{"type":"text","value":"。","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"o8Cldt5VnQ"}],"key":"E8JmTnO1DP"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"细胞的调控状态是决定细胞身份的重要因素。本部分聚焦染色质可及性数据，主要来自 ","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"t8WYKXcOq4"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"单细胞转座酶可及染色质测序（single-cell assay for transposase-accessible chromatin using sequencing, scATAC-seq）","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"MYKi3bAhR3"}],"key":"siW5nUI3Sf"},{"type":"text","value":"，也包括 ","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"AZ9CbR1sT2"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"10x Multiome 测定（Assay，在同一细胞核中联合测量染色质可及性与 RNA）","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"g3R3yElJek"}],"key":"fXZdWbfw6u"},{"type":"text","value":"。","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"eq6FP2OosM"}],"key":"dw1s5uFLFH"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"完成预处理后，可以利用这些数据：","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"PMoywxLeYm"}],"key":"KpFkK01fln"},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"spread":false,"position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"从不同于 scRNA-seq 的角度刻画细胞身份","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"key":"vvC21Bq46W"}],"key":"HLjzLtkU5j"}],"key":"FVH3LEeKbs"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"识别细胞状态特异的转录调控因子","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"dEuSxFMjiX"}],"key":"xa8N9eWKPr"}],"key":"Grem2vaPq9"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"将基因表达与序列特征（sequence feature）联系起来","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"key":"fbxMdPuokF"}],"key":"AndKBNXAGj"}],"key":"t4SsaQghl6"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"解析驱动细胞分化和疾病状态的表观遗传机制","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"agV9D4miZq"}],"key":"xjKPtwg63y"}],"key":"bFDjpb9jsl"}],"key":"HfolkNnV55"}],"visibility":"show","key":"xj7gn79dLt"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"实验方法","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"v5CNT5WMsg"}],"identifier":"experimental-assay","label":"Experimental assay","html_id":"experimental-assay","implicit":true,"key":"s4PT09zoxt"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"商用试剂盒是目前广泛采用的实验方案。本书以 10x Multiome 数据演示分析；稍作调整后，同样适用于单模态 10x 单细胞 ATAC-seq 数据。","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"Rl5lYSswAn"}],"key":"jRpoExEeXL"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"转座酶可及染色质测序（assay for transposase-accessible chromatin with high-throughput sequencing, ATAC-seq） 利用 Tn5 转座酶探测开放染色质。以目标组织的单细胞悬液为起点，先提取细胞核，再在 bulk 条件下进行转座反应：Tn5 结合开放区域，同时切割 DNA 并接入测序接头。随后将细胞核加载到 10x Chromium Controller，生成包裹凝胶珠和单个细胞核的乳液微滴（Gel Bead-in-Emulsion, GEM）。微滴内的 RNA 分子和 DNA 片段被加上条形码（Barcode）；破乳后再进行预扩增及后续建库，得到 scATAC-seq 和 RNA 测序文库（library）。","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"rNRpdg21ad"}],"key":"ZnaCiW62qm"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"下图展示了 scATAC-seq 的 DNA 片段化过程 ","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"key":"eGr1mO0IHI"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"atac:martens_modeling_2022","identifier":"atac:martens_modeling_2022","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Martens ","key":"zEjkVl0KDq"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"nwx1Alb23I"}],"key":"Vrcd75j5Ha"},{"type":"text","value":", 2022","key":"fCOaLhv5co"}],"enumerator":"4","key":"ebkd6tfl8a"}],"key":"Mq1JirZx2f"},{"type":"text","value":"。Tn5 在开放染色质区域切割 DNA 并插入测序接头。两次插入可形成一个两端带接头的片段；插入方向十分重要，因为只有两端携带不同接头的片段才能被捕获并扩增。扩增后的片段经过双端测序（paired-end sequencing），再比对到参考基因组（reference genome）。","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"key":"jewgsHoRNp"}],"key":"Kc3PjbQEsC"}],"key":"XgwCGOvXKg"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"container","kind":"figure","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/single-cell-best-practices-zh/build/mechanisms_overview-01b1d5ef3c5149977611d6e08ae0dc40.png","alt":"ATAC-seq 流程概览","width":"800px","key":"lSYErAjfNP","urlSource":"../_static/images/sc_atac/mechanisms_overview.png"},{"type":"caption","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"captionNumber","kind":"figure","label":"ATAC-seq_overview","identifier":"atac-seq_overview","html_id":"atac-seq-overview","enumerator":"2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"图 ","key":"jnPAKTgkLu"},{"type":"text","value":"2","key":"NmuogXThhl"},{"type":"text","value":"：","key":"blD34ObeHp"}],"template":"图 %s：","key":"h8Ko1Yvizx"},{"type":"text","value":"ATAC-seq 流程概览。图片来源：","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"JVTDgClDUu"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"atac:martens_modeling_2022","identifier":"atac:martens_modeling_2022","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Martens ","key":"vedHhCz4Wg"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"GFJiEt8ekQ"}],"key":"FZTQuHX621"},{"type":"text","value":", 2022","key":"x8xP7SyOvh"}],"enumerator":"4","key":"w0LX36RpHN"}],"key":"Cq5n1wpuRu"},{"type":"text","value":"。","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"AuTCM4mrNd"}],"key":"eHlGjkBGmR"}],"key":"XuLkijgD0F"}],"class":"bg-primary mb-1","label":"ATAC-seq_overview","identifier":"atac-seq_overview","enumerator":"2","html_id":"atac-seq-overview","key":"MI2HfrNM8N"}],"key":"buQXnKlMEy"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"数据特点：feature 定义与稀疏性","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"x3JV6esnOu"}],"label":"chromatin-accessibility-introduction-key-takeaway-2","identifier":"chromatin-accessibility-introduction-key-takeaway-2","html_id":"chromatin-accessibility-introduction-key-takeaway-2","key":"B5fN3vLoW7"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"scATAC-seq 覆盖整个基因组的编码区和非编码区，因此通常不能像 scRNA-seq 那样直接把基因作为预定义 特征（feature）。常见做法是寻找可及性高于背景的区域，也就是基因组上片段计数（Count）分布中的峰（peak）。基因区域的开放状态可提示转录潜能；非编码区的开放状态则可能是 TF 等调控蛋白结合的前提或结果。若汇总所有细胞后统一识别峰（peak calling），细胞类型特异的信号和稀有群体的信号可能被掩盖。为此，可以先在不依赖峰的表示上对细胞聚类（clustering），再分别识别各簇的峰。SnapATAC","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"key":"tGcWoh0pXD"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"atac:fang_comprehensive_2021","identifier":"atac:fang_comprehensive_2021","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Fang ","key":"WCkh0ITdgW"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"Mv4TDC4a7I"}],"key":"VmgasWHyGF"},{"type":"text","value":", 2021","key":"wVWz93LWlO"}],"enumerator":"5","key":"AuCT9cK3Iq"}],"key":"Ur8yTIPRiP"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 ArchR","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"key":"A1quMKLk4T"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"atac:granja_archr_2021","identifier":"atac:granja_archr_2021","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Granja ","key":"aQ5Mh2dpCZ"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"r1mMJhuae6"}],"key":"z6EOXjDsCQ"},{"type":"text","value":", 2021","key":"wjQifOqM72"}],"enumerator":"6","key":"uXBSYlhL3T"}],"key":"w5gFEqmDi3"},{"type":"text","value":" 提出了基因组分箱（binning）策略：将整个基因组划分为等长窗口（bin），把这些窗口作为 feature 用于细胞聚类。","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"key":"ATgDlRC9zG"}],"key":"JDWn8OVPSn"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"定义 feature 集合后，需要量化每个细胞在各 feature 中的 Tn5 信号。主要有三种策略：统计重叠的读段（Read）数、统计重叠的片段数，或将信号二值化（binarization）。10x Genomics 的 Cell Ranger ATAC 流程（pipeline）统计峰区域内的 Read，而 Signac ","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"key":"Ry9l5sPVn4"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"atac:stuart_multimodal_2020","identifier":"atac:stuart_multimodal_2020","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Stuart ","key":"zR1GHDNoZN"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"KceSulpyTk"}],"key":"wiScqcC0ZN"},{"type":"text","value":", 2020","key":"YQYj8JZsYa"}],"enumerator":"7","key":"GgebWpwFVy"}],"key":"kYzIHLB5Ol"},{"type":"text","value":" 统计与 feature 重叠的片段。ArchR ","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"key":"xLf7jONqah"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"atac:granja_archr_2021","identifier":"atac:granja_archr_2021","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Granja ","key":"enlwjhqwkP"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"jC1qN4SBwb"}],"key":"Nb0muNodqw"},{"type":"text","value":", 2021","key":"mLghJbc6UF"}],"enumerator":"6","key":"zIRNUuJtWw"}],"key":"rnOnmXe8En"},{"type":"text","value":" 则统计 Read 末端，并在相应的默认分析流程中使用二值化表示。","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"key":"tOF3Kwjhls"}],"key":"trfsMVFG12"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"按 Read 或片段计数会得到不同的 Count 分布。scATAC-seq 的双端测序为每个片段产生一对通常相距较近的 Read；若两端都落在同一 feature 内，该片段就贡献两个 Read。只有一端落在 feature 内时，才可能产生奇数 Count ","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"key":"P7ul7DNRBf"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"atac:martens_modeling_2022","identifier":"atac:martens_modeling_2022","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Martens ","key":"AaOShzAq3A"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"W8wiXwPJjz"}],"key":"z0tgpBNPRT"},{"type":"text","value":", 2022","key":"KurBpT3nJy"}],"enumerator":"4","key":"OXccMAZLSN"}],"key":"uRAdNjRQfO"},{"type":"text","value":"。因此，按 Read 计数时，偶数 Count 往往远多于奇数 Count；按片段计数则没有这种成对累加的效应 ","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"key":"qf0rt8O0Zg"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"atac:martens_modeling_2022","identifier":"atac:martens_modeling_2022","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Martens ","key":"gSF9MGaHgk"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"MyVOFPAI7D"}],"key":"lILkIPWpnZ"},{"type":"text","value":", 2022","key":"OTccoH0aYT"}],"enumerator":"4","key":"iBCDEb50rD"},{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"atac:miao_is_2022","identifier":"atac:miao_is_2022","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Miao & Kim, 2022","key":"pwtGQK3NC2"}],"enumerator":"8","key":"sJKUYLNQ5X"}],"key":"riNnl8wVVR"},{"type":"text","value":"。","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"key":"wuEReiNxrr"}],"key":"heNWt8Q2Ih"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"scATAC-seq 数据还具有很高的稀疏性。在未复制、无拷贝数变异的二倍体常染色体区域，每个位点通常只有两份 DNA 模板，可贡献的独立片段数十分有限；峰或 bin 跨越较长区域，其 Count 则可大于 2。有限的模板和捕获效率使许多 feature 的 Count 为零，形成高度稀疏的计数矩阵（Count matrix）。一些方法将 Count 二值化：只要有一个 Read 或片段与 feature 重叠，就将其记为可及 ","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"lkxQbSUEfM"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"atac:granja_archr_2021","identifier":"atac:granja_archr_2021","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Granja ","key":"bajHimAOzZ"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"YSb7qQhZDH"}],"key":"lrsrxP6CYQ"},{"type":"text","value":", 2021","key":"vYisQfgLML"}],"enumerator":"6","key":"ZRbrEN1gJU"},{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"atac:bravo_gonzalez-blas_cistopic_2019","identifier":"atac:bravo_gonzalez-blas_cistopic_2019","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Bravo González-Blas ","key":"qw5ISpBiGM"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"akbCZe6tN5"}],"key":"ioku3TI3g8"},{"type":"text","value":", 2019","key":"CYmNPNCrA2"}],"enumerator":"9","key":"xYGdi5GZNv"},{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"atac:bravo_gonzalez-blas_cistopic_2019","identifier":"atac:bravo_gonzalez-blas_cistopic_2019","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Bravo González-Blas ","key":"rIK5tcncmn"},{